    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d264">

                <pb facs="0390" n="302" sameAs="frus:frus1904/pg302"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Porter to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Paris</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1904-04-02"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">April 2,
                    1904</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Porter states that the Assistant Attorney-General and Mr. Russell request
                    that the Attorney-General be informed of an interview <pb facs="0391" n="303"
                        xml:id="pg303"/> they have had with the president of the company, and that
                    they find the company’s views satisfactory. They expect speedy conclusion.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
